{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Problem: seven real pytest fixtures returned complete copies of os.environ and exposed arbitrary ambient secrets when failures rendered fixture arguments/locals.\n\nProven root cause: dict(os.environ) at the seven recorded fixture seams copied unrelated caller credentials into values pytest serializes. Runtime proof inserted a first-position synthetic sentinel; long traceback/local rendering leaked it exactly once on every fixture, while short traceback did not and replacing child invocation did not affect the CLI leak. Minimal PATH-only environments passed all affected behavior tests, ruling out dependency on arbitrary ambient keys.\n\nTest: held-out tests/unit/test_fixture_env_repr_security.py was RED on all seven real fixture surfaces, GREEN after a blind fix, and the exact dict(os.environ) mutation at offline_acli_env returned its case to RED. The child harness now carries only the synthetic sentinel and PATH.\n\nFix: each fixture now returns a fresh mutable allowlisted mapping containing only its required PATH/state/path settings; health retains HEALTH_TIMEOUT=1, observability retains its offsets and REPL_LOG, and CLI remains fake-acli-first with Jira credentials absent by construction.\n\nScope & safety: all mappings remain mutable for existing overrides; no production code or dependency changed and no test was weakened. Focused result: 42 passed, 1 integration deselected after the parallel-gate .mypy_cache interference was rerun sequentially. make lint and make typecheck passed.\n\nSiblings: the seven guaranteed fixture-argument surfaces were fixed. The distinct class of 103 test-local subprocess mappings is tracked in antiutopic-toadyish-goldfinch; production/maintenance propagation sites are accepted exclusions because preserving caller configuration is their product contract.\n\nReplication: the original long-trace sentinel leak no longer reproduces on any of the seven surfaces; all fourteen long/short oracle cases pass."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787033351832270001,"uuid":"8f418c2d-d4e2-42fd-8c11-3ecbd145ab76"}